        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, yes, about the same, about four days. With severe tummy pain out of proportion to the examination, I'd say every other day.",
